msgctxt "148"
msgid "Man, I could go for a nice, warm cup of alcohol right about now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"Oh, if that's the case, sir, then how about this stuff called Tantakatan? My"
" girlfriend told me it's really good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Tantakatan? What's it like? The name's already got me hooked."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"It's a type of shochu made from perilla leaves with a very mild taste. My "
"girlfriend says it's good both on the rocks or mixed with fruit juice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"Sounds damn tasty. Let's go find a good seafood place and order up a bottle "
"or two!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"(Tantakatan, huh? I should remember this when I'm over at a cabaret club.)"
msgstr ""

